{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"ac5c8f6946e43cacc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Decision Diagrams (BDD/MDD/ZDD) 在组合优化的应用 2024-2026。\n\n**背景：** Round 1-8 完全没碰这个。Hooker 等学者把 MDD 推到 OR 圈很多年，Bergman 等的 DDOpt 方向。看是否对我们 placement 有用。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. BDD/MDD/ZDD 基础 + Hooker 工作综述\n2. DDOpt / decision diagram-based optimization 现状\n3. SymBDD 等工具\n4. 跟 LCG / lazy clause generation 的关系\n5. 对 placement / packing 的应用（如有）\n\n输出末尾：\"是否值得 PoC\"。"},"uuid":"30bcf5a7-3d77-491a-aa97-389aab7b07d3","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:06:02.881Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
